<title>中国三季度GDP同比增4.5%、环比增1.2%。9月社会商品零售37830亿、同比增1.0%，餐饮收入4603亿、同比增</title>
<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35710</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35710</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 03:04:13 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div>中国三季度GDP同比增4.5%、环比增1.2%。<br/>9月社会商品<a href="https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/zxfbhjd/202610/t20261019_1965614.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">零售</a>37830亿、同比增1.0%，餐饮收入4603亿、同比增2.1%。好于预期。<br/>9月<a href="https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/zxfb/202610/t20261019_1965617.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">规上工业增加值</a>同比增5.5%、环比增0.61%。<br/>1–9月<a href="https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/zxfbhjd/202610/t20261019_1965616.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">固定资产投资</a>同比下降7.2%，扣除房地产后下降4.2%。其中国有控股投资同比降3.2%。<br/>9月出口30344亿元，同比增29.6%；进口21284亿元，同比增24.6%。<br/>9月末<a href="https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/zxfbhjd/202610/t20261019_1965615.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">商品房</a>待售74825万平、同比降1.5%，其中住宅39697万平、同比降0.7%。<br/>9月CPI同比涨0.9%、环比涨0.2%，PPI同比涨5.0%、环比涨1.2%。<br/>1–9月城镇居民人均可支配收入44945元（中位数39728）同比名义增4.5%、实际增3.6%；农村人均可支配收入18809元（中位数15895元）同比名义增6.3%、实际增5.6%。<br/>（<a href="https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/zxfbhjd/202610/t20261019_1965618.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">国家统计局</a>，<a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/china/chinas-economic-growth-picks-up-third-quarter-beating-expectations-2026-10-19/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">路透社</a>）</div>]]></description>
</item>
