<title>法国多地10月17日爆发抗议活动，数万人因物价上涨和公共支出下降走上街头，同时表达对抗议学生的支持。警方与抗议者爆发冲突</title>
<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35702</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35702</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:07:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">法国多地10月17日爆发抗议活动，数万人因物价上涨和公共支出下降走上街头，同时表达对抗议学生的支持。警方与抗议者爆发冲突。<br/>在巴黎，有汽车和报刊亭被纵火，警方使用催泪瓦斯和水炮驱散暴力抗议者。但更多的和平抗议者高唱国歌、挥舞国旗进行游行。在里昂和马赛等地，有政府建筑物被纵火或破坏。<br/>截至下午，已有272人因暴力事件被捕。<br/>（<a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/students-trade-unions-yellow-vests-set-protest-across-france-2026-10-17/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">路透社</a>，<a href="https://apnews.com/article/france-school-protests-yellow-vest-44b9d3ba91ffad4029f975dced7e31cb" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美联社</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/NeLTCFLJQo2riQxrvPi6BKtweev5yFnIZBb48rieYw2pI7rBeCc4NtQcIi4qAAVApTNsbbLs9Zxw--Nx2aLlxDK0TkrJg7XMjhKzKwHkTxRjqASNb76bVdqEriQhP6ZehNvplBYjo0znpQolLonJxFcwjUptIVdXR642Vk7CM-MeCmG2-wKC0MFLljyrzgDrH3mFS9zo822UTrcNr6D9qO8G-A9E3RFJlc3I4uRqy0AN87FQXfimKDqZXid9EXg5gI5IMJaWtez2bSCWGuHtEUxJIQpwcBfen5Bo7hciGs8bEC6Mi63Lm9oamlqmMCJAl712Eood41PWePVyo3UXCQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/fyYkUtDwsUcimX3QO4C8OqwihnFJOtiFbb3MvcdNV4r5khql_g3NVlMupxkFzg_TN2k60-qhF8EgQNLLfDS-qtAbhLrnlHJCRZHN2UErzkpUb6fC4Hn4GH5SVPZE_V57xuAfiJtnfE3taiZye1IOmNjzkkX1fPIVzW3epIPTYKa65-gqmkT9qo1ZIWIWRCd4jhjcGQrGJeiwlzoau1X-deutOJ1wnqJjIA73icQ8xHFtwqBp2tIALbNUMuJ_9UDmhpnXdqCLheNp4O2wQg4RIUGrvUZr2LGdrQ79PF38hywSeVgLndfDJbBho5ftvroPJF-0g1_cBEqfKWQ0b8iwFA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/MWVwI1ix8tDKldpm4SZykDIxD8mIgjhRX3rBVaf2kwMRqhp8JM5R2_Eh2k0XVW7UyUGL6kA14rfmV9DGDcn0ag6zaInsAh95CLIozQtZ0YYxHN1z9gYwMtWlwO_ec_3SdMZrozqEA7--_rlGjxZY_8MdKqSep7LmJ16Qw_LmxG1Cwz_BqNWLuxBJEbxOKGP81CdcYd_rjjJWIU1UlIGaTxRWHsXLNq0qivqePf8JdHGq5a948gy1UQvDWvkqRNv99WonKbMWGthtqTeqXeO1UTO00ZbCtloBLL9e1cDsrDy0pw4YjZyCaqCLSpTMsgQLXcz