<title>俄罗斯堪察加半岛北京时间10月16日11:35:31发生6.9级地震，震源深度135千米。日本气象厅一度将地震规模误报至</title>
<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35694</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35694</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 05:11:38 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">俄罗斯堪察加半岛北京时间10月16日11:35:31发生6.9级地震，震源深度135千米。<br/>日本气象厅一度将地震规模误报至9.9级，并针对北海道至东海地方几乎全域发布最大震度7的<a href="https://eew-history.dmdata.ne.jp/20261016123810" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">紧急地震速报</a>。约8分48秒后气象厅撤销了紧急地震速报，这也是紧急地震速报系统自2008年投入运行以来，首次撤销紧急地震速报“警报”的发布。<br/>此次地震日本实际录得最大震度1，在北海道函馆市。NHK北海道各放送局均未感受到明显摇晃。<br/>此次误报导致东海道新干线一度停运。JR东日本表示，东北新干线和在来线的运行未受此次紧急地震速报影响。<br/>日本气象厅在当地时间14时召开的记者会上表示，正在调查此次误报的详情，并否认系统遭受网络攻击。<br/>（<a href="https://earthquake.usgs.gov/earthquakes/eventpage/us6000u2mq/executive" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美国地质调查局</a>，NHK <a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60368" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">1</a>，<a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60369" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">2</a>，<a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60374" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">3</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/qFn-ZrNDNoohYp-K-KnnVBwI_Am0YuvuIJCIrRW1ZenwGUikVSh2oJmcNl3uOumD-4laD-OBDysb5WFSBKWHhkYMPa5NACygzAF8nMqrn_88ebpO4e4yUcWpde7Rb8a78Qs8naeKHDXO_eI0smHk91IAqTh3hoMgUJkhd_u3ktAra6EVx-56dqAVvMy4pD9w3YLuMB15soXbLn6HKzK2Vy5l5V-1PGtwspinAYJxkzkJDVQu6a80_cQJ4AOafdBNfZzM21JEWhIhMhtyEKAymFAzlri-pQ56v9dnaJM7AFo792xWRY0oNZHeb3KEkJSQvcmA-059o1llKVm6YOvwLQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/i9mWuigUL2iLsV4UFrrNtlKL64qNbaBVbAVxPTbuFH5AlhNko6mdFEk2U6sMRuE4xz1BlzWiUAud2-TWfxSFUVOQE2Pa26ro5QJUch52Zqn3XBXBOFBMg7yjW-nrcSE4RdCuMmfvyu0uB_fDWcZYE-tXEbkwqV0MauDSUlLzOGAaJ-ujCs_4NT75f0bmODDQ93-AQ-NJi6HuswkFJ6l-zUUXDnfEPbcEYXAGr1ODICtak2dJ9YU3m9Sa9yEQ8RKqyOWDNnf-t3XxKmMyw20haT5W2OkepAxcgpmP7BYoXVun615tS1m30dCogYo-ZI5NrqvBWuQ85wiXDPxPyln3Jg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/i3F_lk49GvFHIr_Qkql2k5F3FptaZWnaS9axcAilietJlf9sIx0vb2hG1N9THK8HdLuS3Sjd3sQ7VKU5hzkV0XE5bFRWEmSo-96SyRL8agm2oo3b4tG1z95kCwC7V4nbfO4OBHsRiYAfF5b52r15FlaUNP1VVS0RqHGLVOwvXISUDV3xRDxiDpiHhTPl281F167Y5q900vUqcKu3DTWSPnTXnEQ8Ku0Vhiwrne0_jHv_fQltO3PKJSHdS_44JdAEstUp4n8pzPnpNsJIcxmmHNgbUSK887Wbt_aMIbZOhew9ojx3Lql3q_fImj6P-j7upbPd5e6Knp2GmS6Nuk-_yw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/kHsIgVPB5nIrLlMR57fTMxJtGDbqC48iLg0gytc55adc_fA-_cuUpyLLAV00oj_8QVZkaRdbDYJDXq3Jvn5aKIkDtH2gtNlquP-OtE6xRs2xbNivhJ11tAQGSZFbrtH5YvJB_La6lQNV-PXYZFP0UAsaFIQ8o_FLlLVzEPgVTlTVKuYNqfTgzZqkJTDYHa3BXbuLxgV2kE3FhguUsCtjEfMs6pav_bkdw-15zLgTpXnnWTC7a9BUfgJAzFSHaXWd9cOXXvCfNaW9MylGZ2mWDjNnMPGlIGD5rFI2L202cWEaP_JPn2pRViLlUXhxdL-JAWddyeYs58Ww8lFg3GAw-w.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
